<BaseLayout title="Cancellations & refunds | Zion Creative" description="Cancellations & refunds for Zion Creative."><Header/><main id="main" class="container policy-page"><h1>Cancellations & refunds</h1><p>This website does not process online purchases or payments.</p><h2>Before starting a project</h2><p>Please request and review the cancellation and refund terms in the proposal or agreement for your specific project before making a payment. This page does not introduce a blanket nonrefundable deposit rule or replace an existing agreement.</p><h2>Existing projects</h2><p>To request cancellation, ask about a payment, or discuss a refund, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a> and identify the project. Avoid including payment card numbers or bank account details. Refer to the agreed project terms when making your request. Any rights that apply under law continue to apply.</p></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>
